<p>All prices are shown in US dollars and may change at any time without notice. We have made every effort to display our products and their colours accurately, but we cannot guarantee your screen renders colour exactly — a warm white on your monitor may differ slightly from the light in your room.</p>
<p>Product descriptions, dimensions and specifications are provided in good faith. We reserve the right to limit quantities, refuse any order, or discontinue a product at any time. If we cancel an order you have already paid for, we refund it in full.</p>
