<h2>6. Installation and safety</h2>
<p>Our lighting is sold for ordinary domestic use and is supplied for US voltage and outlets. Hardwired fixtures should be installed by a qualified electrician in accordance with local electrical codes. Do not exceed the maximum wattage stated for a fixture, and do not use an indoor fixture outdoors. We are not liable for damage or injury resulting from improper installation, modification or use of a product.</p>
